  Notation RETx mm x5 x6 x7 x10 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17 x28 x29 x30 x31 :=
    (MS (mkR ra (Z_to_bv 64 SP) gp tp x5 x6 x7 s0 s1 x10 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 x28 x29 x30 x31)
